---
description: Rules for working with the Uncoil SDK and traces
alwaysApply: false
---

When a task involves Uncoil (tracing, runs, cost, feedback scores):

- Use the `uncoil` skill first; it looks up current docs through the `uncoil-docs` server.
- Sign in with `npx @uncoil.dev/sdk login`. Never ask for or paste an API key into chat, and keep `.env.local` out of git.
- Verify that a first trace arrives before calling the setup done.
